@jimp/jpeg-js is a fork of jpeg-js (https://github.com/jpeg-js/jpeg-js). Its
files come from several projects under different licenses, all of them
permissive. This file says which license covers which files, then gives the
full text of each license.

  lib/decoder.js   Apache License 2.0 (section 2). The JPEG decoder of jpgjs
                   by notmasteryet, as copied into jpeg-js.
  lib/encoder.js   BSD 3-Clause License, Adobe Systems (section 3). The
                   JPGEncoder of as3corelib, ported to JavaScript by Andreas
                   Ritter.
  everything else  BSD 3-Clause License, Eugene Ware (section 1). The jpeg-js
                   wrapper, tests and packaging.

See NOTICE for the Apache License 2.0 attribution notices.

Modifications made for @jimp/jpeg-js are Copyright (c) 2026 Jimp contributors
and are released under the license of the file they were made in.


